  "experimental_role": "The grouped working profile plus streamed prefill and the lean prefill host path, for two V100 PCIe 32 GB GPUs, dual Xeon Gold 6240 and 181 GiB RAM. Four same-job pairs at a 12288 context (sources v532, v538, v542, v553) measured 779.79-783.71 prefill / 41.34-41.73 decode tok/s against 519.69-522.86 / 41.17-41.47 for the grouped control: three full warmups and three timed 8192-input/512-output requests per side, identical 512-token outputs, zero timed major faults. The pairs ran with STRATA_GLM_FP4_EVICTION_STATS=1 (a report line) on both sides. Eight reused long and eight reused natural-length coding cases passed on both sides of the v532, v538 and v542 pairs; long-panel answers differ from the control's from the third case. The 800 prefill tok/s target is not met at this context. Fresh20 and HumanEval not run. See docs/GLM_FP4_V100_PREFILL.md."
